# ============================================================
# Salve Season Data
# ============================================================
# Salve's alert sound is keyed per spell ID, because that is the only thing
# C_UnitAuras.AddAuraSound accepts -- it cannot take a filter. Salve itself
# never learns what it is dispelling, so the IDs have to be listed somewhere.
#
# They live HERE, in a companion addon, so a new season's debuffs are a data
# update rather than a new release of the addon. Same idea as BigWigs shipping
# a module per zone.
#
# RequiredDeps plus the matching name prefix makes the addon list show this as a
# collapsible child of Salve rather than a separate entry.

Data.lua
